"<title>Snake Racer 3D</title>
<meta name=\"claude:viewport-fit-sides\" content=\"cover\">
<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Barlow+Semi+Condensed:wght@500;600@COMMENT_BODY@family=Russo+One@COMMENT_BODY@display=swap\">
<style>
/* Layout: one-screen game. Title strip, race HUD (one lane per racer), 3D arena in the middle, analog stick (left) and turbo (right) at the bottom.
   Committed single look: asphalt arena, red/white kerbs, orange player car, three rival colors. */
:root {
  --bg: #15171a;
  --panel: #1f2328;
  --asphalt: #2d3036;
  --asphalt-2: #33373d;
  --kerb-red: #d6382f;
  --kerb-white: #f2efe9;
  --player: #ff7a1a;
  --rival: #2ab7e8;
  --rival-2: #b06cff;
  --rival-3: #9bd33b;
  --nitro: #ffd23f;
  --good: #5bd37a;
  --ink: #f2efe9;
  --muted: #a0a6ae;
  --line: #343a42;
  --scrim: rgba(21, 23, 26, 0.8);
  --font-display: 'Russo One', 'Arial Black', Impact, sans-serif;
  --font-body: 'Barlow Semi Condensed', 'Arial Narrow', Arial, sans-serif;
  --stick: 128px;
  color-scheme: dark;
}
* { box-sizing: border-box; }
html, body { height: 100%; }
body {
  margin: 0;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 8px;
  padding-block: 10px;
  padding-left: max(16px, env(safe-area-inset-left, 0px));
  padding-right: max(16px, env(safe-area-inset-right, 0px));
  background: var(--bg);
  color: var(--ink);
  font-family: var(--font-body);
  font-size: 15px;
  overflow: hidden;
  overscroll-behavior: none;
  -webkit-user-select: none;
  user-select: none;
  -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;
}
.top { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 12px; }
h1 { margin: 0; font: 400 19px/1 var(--font-display); letter-spacing: 0.04em; text-transform: uppercase; white-space: nowrap; }
h1 span { color: var(--player); }
.top-right { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; }
#clock { font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; color: var(--muted); min-width: 4.6em; text-align: right; }
.chip {
  appearance: none; border: 1px solid var(--line); background: var(--panel); color: var(--muted);
  font: 600 12px var(--font-body); letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase;
  padding: 6px 10px; border-radius: 6px; cursor: pointer; white-space: nowrap;
}
.chip:focus-visible, .btn:focus-visible, .turbo:focus-visible, .stick:focus-visible, .seg button:focus-visible, .txt:focus-visible, input[type=range]:focus-visible { outline: 3px solid var(--kerb-white); outline-offset: 2px; }

.hud { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 6px 14px; }
.lane { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; min-width: 0; --c: var(--player); }
.lane b { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--c); }
.lane em { font-style: normal; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; color: var(--ink); }
.pips { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(10, 1fr); gap: 3px; }
.pips i { height: 8px; border-radius: 2px; background: var(--panel); box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px var(--line); }
.pips i.on { background: var(--c); box-shadow: none; }
.nitro { grid-column: 1 / -1; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--muted); }
.bar { flex: 1; height: 8px; border-radius: 4px; background: var(--panel); box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px var(--line); overflow: hidden; }
.bar i { display: block; height: 100%; width: 100%; background: var(--nitro); }
.pw { min-width: 6.5em; text-align: right; color: var(--nitro); letter-spacing: 0.06em; }
.lives { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 4px; min-width: 3.2em; }
.lives i { width: 11px; height: 11px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--kerb-red); display: inline-block; }
.lives i.off { background: var(--panel); box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px var(--line); }

.stage { position: relative; flex: 1 1 0; min-height: 0; border-radius: 6px; overflo

---
This is a build request. Build a complete, playable game now (or apply the requested change to the existing game). Do not ask clarifying questions; make reasonable assumptions and note them briefly when you finish.

Screenshots for your own checks: save small JPEGs (a .jpg path, viewport at most 1280px wide) and read only the latest one; older images are dropped from context. Read a full-size PNG only when fine detail matters.
"

